    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to Sector 7. The rain hasn't stopped for weeks, washing away the neon reflections in the gutter. You are a rogue Netrunner tasked with breaching the Omni-Corp Mainframe. They hold the digital consciousness of your mentor hostage. The system is heavily guarded by layers of cryptographic firewalls and physical synth-locks. To get past the ultimate Nexus Validator and secure his release, you must dive deep into the corporation's subnet, decrypting their core algorithms and piecing together the broken data fragments left behind by previous runners. Time is ticking. The corporate sweepers are already tracking your trace.",
